  "description": "Kid-Friendly 200W Performance\nDesigned for riders ages 6–14, the 200W motor delivers smooth acceleration and speeds up to 12 MPH for exciting everyday rides.\n\nBluetooth Music & Colorful Lights\nConnect a phone through Bluetooth to play music, while the bright headlight and colorful deck lights make every ride more fun and visible.\n\nUp to 9 Miles of Riding Fun\nThe 25.2V 2.6Ah battery provides up to 9 miles of range and recharges in approximately 3 hours.\n\nSolid Tires & Dual Braking\nMaintenance-free 6.5-inch solid tires provide dependable everyday riding, while the electronic brake and rear foot brake offer simple, responsive stopping.\n\nLightweight, Foldable & Easy to Carry\nWeighing only 15.2 lbs, the S4 folds easily for transport and storage and supports riders up to 154 lbs.",
